{"id":"U08","title":"Humility: The Key to Successful Relationships","titleZh":"谦逊：成功关系的关键","paras":[{"id":"U08-P1","sentences":[{"id":"U08-P1-S1","hard":false,"text":"Many people believe that passion and commitment are the foundations of strong romantic relationships."},{"id":"U08-P1-S2","hard":false,"text":"But a relationship is made of two unique individuals."},{"id":"U08-P1-S3","hard":true,"text":"And the personality traits these individuals possess or lack can often make a relationship more- or less-likely to endure."},{"id":"U08-P1-S4","hard":true,"text":"Recent research has found that one trait in particular--humility--is an important indicator of successful relationships."}],"zh":"许多人认为激情和承诺是牢固恋爱关系的基础。但一段关系由两个独特的个体组成。而这些个体拥有或缺乏的性格特质，往往会使一段关系更有可能或更不可能长久维持。最近的研究发现，有一种特质尤其重要——谦逊——是成功关系的重要指标。"},{"id":"U08-P2","sentences":[{"id":"U08-P2-S1","hard":false,"text":"Humility can sometimes be confused with a lack of confidence."},{"id":"U08-P2-S2","hard":false,"text":"But researchers have come to realize that being humble generally indicates the presence of deeply admirable personal qualities."},{"id":"U08-P2-S3","hard":true,"text":"Being humble means you have the ability to accurately assess your deficiencies without denying your skills and strengths."}],"zh":"谦逊有时会被与缺乏自信混淆。但研究人员逐渐意识到，谦逊通常意味着令人深深钦佩的个人品质的存在。谦逊意味着你有能力准确地评估自己的不足，同时不否认自己的技能和长处。"},{"id":"U08-P3","sentences":[{"id":"U08-P3-S1","hard":true,"text":"For example, you might recognize that you are intelligent, but realize that you are not a genius."},{"id":"U08-P3-S2","hard":false,"text":"Thus, humility leads to an honest view of one's own advantages and shortcomings."},{"id":"U08-P3-S3","hard":false,"text":"Humble people do not ignore, avoid, or try to deny their limits or deficiencies."},{"id":"U08-P3-S4","hard":true,"text":"They can acknowledge mistakes, see value in things that are far from perfect and identify areas for improvement."}],"zh":"例如，你可能认识到自己很聪明，但意识到自己并非天才。因此，谦逊使人能够诚实地看待自己的优点和缺点。谦逊的人不会忽视、回避或试图否认自己的局限或不足。他们能够承认错误，在不完美的事物中看到价值，并找出需要改进的地方。"},{"id":"U08-P4","sentences":[{"id":"U08-P4-S1","hard":true,"text":"Perhaps it is not surprising, then, that humility appears to be a huge asset to relationships."},{"id":"U08-P4-S2","hard":false,"text":"One study found that people tend to rate this quality highly in their spouse."},{"id":"U08-P4-S3","hard":true,"text":"The study also found that someone who is humble is more likely to initiate a romantic relationship, perhaps because they are less likely to see themselves as \"too good\" for someone else."},{"id":"U08-P4-S4","hard":false,"text":"Thus, a humble partner might be your ideal partner."}],"zh":"那么，谦逊似乎是人际关系中的一大优势，这并不令人惊讶。一项研究发现，人们倾向于高度评价配偶身上的这种品质。该研究还发现，谦逊的人更有可能主动开启一段恋爱关系，也许是因为他们不太容易认为自己\"太优秀\"而不适合别人。因此，一个谦逊的伴侣可能是你的理想伴侣。"}],"words":[{"id":"U08-W01","lemma":"passion","surface":"passion","pos":"n.","zh":"激情; 热情","sent":"U08-P1-S1","phrases":[{"en":"strong passion","zh":"强烈的激情"},{"en":"have a passion for","zh":"热爱..."}]},{"id":"U08-W02","lemma":"commitment","surface":"commitment","pos":"n.","zh":"承诺; 投入; 奉献","sent":"U08-P1-S1","phrases":[{"en":"make a commitment","zh":"做出承诺"},{"en":"commitment to","zh":"对...的投入"}]},{"id":"U08-W03","lemma":"foundation","surface":"foundations","pos":"n.","zh":"基础; 地基; 基金会","sent":"U08-P1-S1","phrases":[{"en":"lay the foundation","zh":"奠定基础"},{"en":"the foundations of","zh":"...的基础"}]},{"id":"U08-W04","lemma":"romantic","surface":"romantic","pos":"adj.","zh":"浪漫的; 爱情的","sent":"U08-P1-S1","phrases":[{"en":"romantic relationship","zh":"恋爱关系"},{"en":"romantic love","zh":"浪漫爱情"}]},{"id":"U08-W05","lemma":"relationship","surface":"relationships","pos":"n.","zh":"关系; 联系","sent":"U08-P1-S1","phrases":[{"en":"successful relationships","zh":"成功的关系"},{"en":"build a relationship","zh":"建立关系"}]},{"id":"U08-W06","lemma":"individual","surface":"individuals","pos":"n. / adj.","zh":"n. 个人; 个体 adj. 独特的; 个别的","sent":"U08-P1-S2","phrases":[{"en":"unique individuals","zh":"独特的个体"},{"en":"individual needs","z